• We have had a history of losses, and we might not be able to achieve or sustain profitability;
• Our quarterly operating results have fluctuated in the past and might continue to fluctuate causing
the value of our common stock to decline substantially;
• Downturns or upturns in sales are not immediately reflected in full in our operating results;
• The COVID-19 pandemic could have an adverse impact on our business and the duration and
extent to which the pandemic will impact our future financial performance remains uncertain;
• Our business could be negatively affected as a result of the actions of activist stockholders;
